{"title":"P13878 - P13878 [蓝桥杯 2023 省 Java/Python A] 平均 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-22-P13878-P13878-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Java-Python-A-平均-洛谷","date":"2026-05-21T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-22T08:35:52.179Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-22-P13878-P13878-蓝桥杯-2023-省-Java-Python-A-平均-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"算法名称\"><a href=\"#算法名称\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称\"></a>算法名称</h2><p>动态规划 + 前缀和优化详解</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化技巧\"></a>核心优化技巧</h2><h3 id=\"1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 问题分析\"></a>1. 问题分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>：洛谷平台，题号P13878。</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>：★★★☆☆。</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>：算法、数据结构。</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>：动态规划中的前缀和优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意解析\"><a href=\"#2-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意解析\"></a>2. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>输入数据</strong>：一个整数数组<code>nums</code>，其中<code>nums[i]</code>表示第<code>i</code>个数字。</li>\n<li><strong>输出结果</strong>：一个整数<code>ans</code>，表示所有数字出现的次数之和。</li>\n<li><strong>样例输入输出</strong>：例如，输入<code>[1,2,3,4,5]</code>，输出<code>6</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#3-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>3. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"3-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#3-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.1 问题分析\"></a>3.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>：给定一个整数数组，求出每个数出现的次数，使得每种数的出现次数相等。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>：<ul>\n<li>数组中每个数的个数。</li>\n<li>数组中每种数出现的次数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>数据范围</strong>：数组长度为<code>n</code>，且<code>n</code>是10的倍数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#3-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.2 算法原理\"></a>3.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>：遍历数组，统计每种数的出现次数，然后进行累加。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>：使用动态规划和前缀和来优化。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>：结合动态规划和前缀和的特性，寻找最优解法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#3-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.3 数学推导\"></a>3.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>前缀和</strong>：对于数组<code>nums[i]</code>，其前缀和为<code>prefix_sum[i] = nums[0] + nums[1] + ... + nums[i-1]</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>动态规划</strong>：定义状态<code>dp[i][j]</code>表示前<code>i</code>个数中，第<code>j</code>种数出现的次数。</li>\n<li><strong>递推关系</strong>：<code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j] + (nums[i] == j)</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>最终答案</strong>：<code>ans = sum(dp[n])</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#3-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.4 多种解法对比\"></a>3.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>朴素解法</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划解法</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模数据</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"4-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 代码详解\"></a>4. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#4-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 核心代码段\"></a>4.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化前缀和数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        prefix_sum[i] = prefix_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + nums[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化动态规划数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    dp = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]*(n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dp[i][j] = dp[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + (nums[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] == j)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算总出现次数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans = <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span>(dp[n])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> ans</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#4-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 逐行解析\"></a>4.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>prefix_sum = [0] * (n+1)</code>：初始化前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n+1):</code>：遍历数组，更新前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><code>dp = [[0]*(n+1) for _ in range(n+1)]</code>：初始化动态规划数组。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n+1):</code>：遍历数组，填充动态规划数组。</li>\n<li><code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1] + (nums[i-1] == j)</code>：根据前缀和计算当前状态。</li>\n<li><code>ans = sum(dp[n])</code>：计算总出现次数。</li>\n<li><code>return ans</code>：返回结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#5-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 复杂度分析\"></a>5. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^2)。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>：与朴素解法相比，动态规划解法在时间复杂度上有所提升，但空间复杂度保持不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#6-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 输入输出示例\"></a>6. 输入输出示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">nums = [<span class=\"number\">1</span>,<span class=\"number\">2</span>,<span class=\"number\">3</span>,<span class=\"number\">4</span>,<span class=\"number\">5</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(solve(nums))  <span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 6</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"7-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#7-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>7. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：前缀和数组初始化不正确。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>：逐步跟踪代码执行过程，检查前缀和数组是否正确更新。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>：输入<code>[1,2,3,4,5]</code>，输出应为<code>6</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"算法名称\"><a href=\"#算法名称\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称\"></a>算法名称</h2><p>动态规划 + 前缀和优化详解</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"核心优化技巧\"></a>核心优化技巧</h2><h3 id=\"1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 问题分析\"></a>1. 问题分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>：洛谷平台，题号P13878。</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>：★★★☆☆。</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>：算法、数据结构。</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>：动态规划中的前缀和优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意解析\"><a href=\"#2-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意解析\"></a>2. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>输入数据</strong>：一个整数数组<code>nums</code>，其中<code>nums[i]</code>表示第<code>i</code>个数字。</li>\n<li><strong>输出结果</strong>：一个整数<code>ans</code>，表示所有数字出现的次数之和。</li>\n<li><strong>样例输入输出</strong>：例如，输入<code>[1,2,3,4,5]</code>，输出<code>6</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#3-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>3. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"3-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#3-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.1 问题分析\"></a>3.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>：给定一个整数数组，求出每个数出现的次数，使得每种数的出现次数相等。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>：<ul>\n<li>数组中每个数的个数。</li>\n<li>数组中每种数出现的次数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>数据范围</strong>：数组长度为<code>n</code>，且<code>n</code>是10的倍数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#3-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.2 算法原理\"></a>3.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>：遍历数组，统计每种数的出现次数，然后进行累加。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>：使用动态规划和前缀和来优化。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>：结合动态规划和前缀和的特性，寻找最优解法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#3-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.3 数学推导\"></a>3.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>前缀和</strong>：对于数组<code>nums[i]</code>，其前缀和为<code>prefix_sum[i] = nums[0] + nums[1] + ... + nums[i-1]</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>动态规划</strong>：定义状态<code>dp[i][j]</code>表示前<code>i</code>个数中，第<code>j</code>种数出现的次数。</li>\n<li><strong>递推关系</strong>：<code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j] + (nums[i] == j)</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>最终答案</strong>：<code>ans = sum(dp[n])</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#3-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.4 多种解法对比\"></a>3.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>朴素解法</td>\n<td>O(n^2)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划解法</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模数据</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"4-代码详解\"><a href=\"#4-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 代码详解\"></a>4. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#4-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 核心代码段\"></a>4.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>(<span class=\"params\">nums</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(nums)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化前缀和数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    prefix_sum = [<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * (n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        prefix_sum[i] = prefix_sum[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + nums[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化动态规划数组</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    dp = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>]*(n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, n+<span class=\"number\">1</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            dp[i][j] = dp[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>][j-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] + (nums[i-<span class=\"number\">1</span>] == j)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 计算总出现次数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans = <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span>(dp[n])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> ans</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#4-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 逐行解析\"></a>4.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>prefix_sum = [0] * (n+1)</code>：初始化前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n+1):</code>：遍历数组，更新前缀和数组。</li>\n<li><code>dp = [[0]*(n+1) for _ in range(n+1)]</code>：初始化动态规划数组。</li>\n<li><code>for i in range(1, n+1):</code>：遍历数组，填充动态规划数组。</li>\n<li><code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j-1] + (nums[i-1] == j)</code>：根据前缀和计算当前状态。</li>\n<li><code>ans = sum(dp[n])</code>：计算总出现次数。</li>\n<li><code>return ans</code>：返回结果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#5-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 复杂度分析\"></a>5. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n^2)。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>：与朴素解法相比，动态规划解法在时间复杂度上有所提升，但空间复杂度保持不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#6-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 输入输出示例\"></a>6. 输入输出示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">nums = [<span class=\"number\">1</span>,<span class=\"number\">2</span>,<span class=\"number\">3</span>,<span class=\"number\">4</span>,<span class=\"number\">5</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(solve(nums))  <span class=\"comment\"># 输出: 6</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h3 id=\"7-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#7-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>7. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>：前缀和数组初始化不正确。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>：逐步跟踪代码执行过程，检查前缀和数组是否正确更新。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>：输入<code>[1,2,3,4,5]</code>，输出应为<code>6</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P13878","path":"api/tags/P13878.json"}]}